  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your music and magic are melded into a magnificent melody.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Spellsong<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add your mythic tier to the DC of Perception or Sense Motive checks to detect your spellcasting when you mask it within performance. Whenever you spend rounds of bardic performance to cast or maintain a spell using Spellsong, or to cast a spell while maintaining a bardic performance, you increase the DC of that spell by 1. When casting a spell from the bard list, you may expend one use of your mythic power as a swift action in order to increase the save DC or caster level of a spell you cast while using Spellsong by an amount equal to one-half your mythic tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc75\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
